      "text": "\n\nHello moderators, this message for the case pm group alert new reaches each member by their level.\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n[Visit Message](http://localhost:3042/t/a-message-to-the-moderators-group-pm-group-alert-new/45/1) to respond to [Moderators (4)](http://localhost:3042/g/moderators), [user1](http://localhost:3042/u/user1).\n\nTo unsubscribe from these emails, [click here](http://localhost:3042/email/unsubscribe/b0e0a7215c95836b77efddbbbcf0fb57ce21517c96427d1d581f6d0b02736b41).\n",
      "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" lang=\"en\" xml:lang=\"en\"><head>\n    <meta http-equiv=\"Content-type\" name=\"viewport\" content=\"initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no, width=device-width\">\n    \n    <meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light dark\">\n    <meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light dark\">\n    \n    <!-- prevent ios zooming + autoscaling -->\n    <meta name=\"x-apple-disable-message-reformatting\">\n    <title></title>\n  </head>\n\n  <body style=\"line-height:1.4;text-align:left\" dir=\"ltr\">\n    <!--[if mso]>\n      <style type=\"text/css\">\n        body,\n        table,\n        td,\n        th,\n        h1,\n        h2,\n        h3 {\n          font-family: Arial, sans-serif !important;\n        }\n      </style>\n    <![endif]-->\n\n    <div style=\"display:none\"></div>\n\n    \n    \n    <div id=\"main\" class=\"\">\n\n  <div class=\"email-preview\" style=\"display:none\"><p>Someone sent you a PM.</p></div>\n\n  <div class=\"header-instructions\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"post-wrapper  \" style=\"margin-bottom:25px\">\n  <table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\">\n    <tbody><tr>\n      <td class=\"user-avatar\" style=\"vertical-align:top;width:55px\">\n        <img src=\"http://localhost:3042/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/u/5daacb/45.png\" title=\"user1\" width=\"45\" height=\"45\">\n      </td>\n      <td>\n          <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"username username-link\" href=\"http://localhost:3042/u/user1\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#006699;font-size:13px;font-family:'lucida grande',tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold\">user1</a>\n        <br>\n        <span class=\"notification-date\" style=\"text-align:right;color:#999999;padding-right:5px;font-family:'lucida grande',tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px\">October 13</span>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody></table>\n  <div class=\"body\" style=\"padding-top:5px\" dm=\"body\"><p style=\"margin-top:0;border:0\">Hello moderators, this message for the case pm group alert new reaches each member by their level.</p></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  <div class=\"footer undecorated-link-footer highlight\" style=\"color:#666\"><hr style=\"background-color:#ddd;height:1px;border:1px\">\n<p><a href=\"http://localhost:3042/t/a-message-to-the-moderators-group-pm-group-alert-new/45/1\" style=\"font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;color:#FFFFFF;background-color:#2F70AC;border-top:4px solid #2F70AC;border-right:6px solid #2F70AC;border-bottom:4px solid #2F70AC;border-left:6px solid #2F70AC;display:inline-block\">Visit Message</a> to respond to <a href=\"http://localhost:3042/g/moderators\" style=\"font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;color:#666\">Moderators (4)</a>, <a href=\"http://localhost:3042/u/user1\" style=\"font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;color:#666\">user1</a>.</p></div>\n  <div class=\"footer\" style=\"color:#666\"><p>To unsubscribe from these emails, <a href=\"http://localhost:3042/email/unsubscribe/b0e0a7215c95836b77efddbbbcf0fb57ce21517c96427d1d581f6d0b02736b41\" style=\"text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;color:#666\">click here</a>.</p></div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/EmailMessage\" style=\"display:none\">\n  <div itemprop=\"action\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/ViewAction\">\n    <link itemprop=\"url\" href=\"http://localhost:3042/t/a-message-to-the-moderators-group-pm-group-alert-new/45/1\">\n    <meta itemprop=\"name\" content=\"Read full topic\">\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n    <!-- prevent Gmail on iOS font size manipulation -->\n    <div style=\"display:none;white-space:nowrap;font:15px courier;line-height:0\">\n      &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\n      &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\n      &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\n    </div>\n    \n    <style>\n      @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n        html {\n          background: #151515 !important;\n        }\n\n        h1,\n        h2,\n        h3,\n        h4,\n        h5,\n        h6,\n        p,\n        span,\n        td {\n          color: inherit !important;\n        }\n\n        [data-stripped-secure-media] {\n          border-color: #454545 !important;\n        }\n\n        [data-stripped-secure-upload] {\n          border-color: #454545 !important;\n        }\n\n        [dm='text-color'] {\n          color: #dddddd;\n        }\n\n        [dm='header'] {\n          background: #151515 !important;\n        }\n\n        [dm='topic-body'] {\n          background: #151515 !important;\n          border-bottom: 1px solid #454545 !important;\n        }\n\n        [dm='triangle'] {\n          border-top-color: #151515 !important;\n        }\n\n        [dm='body'] {\n          background: #222222 !important;\n          color: #dddddd !important;\n        }\n\n        [dm='body_primary'] {\n          background: #062e3d !important;\n          color: #dddddd !important;\n        }\n\n        code,\n        pre code,\n        blockquote {\n          background: #323232 !important;\n          border-color: #454545 !important;\n        }\n      }\n    </style>\n    \n  \n\n</body></html>"
